r from the API which fields are mandatory and which ones are…"],["e0bf192f_521ffd6a",26,-4,0,"[Nit/Question] I couldn't find any guidance that would recommend `_val` suffix in scenarios like this one. Is this a common practice? It seems like it is not needed here (there's no real name clash)."],["57ad47c7_f6b77f89",28,-1,0,"This is a behavior change compared to the old behavior, right? It would be good to explain it in the CL description (and why this change of behavior is acceptable)."],["7cc5af7d_9c1e25ba",29,-1,0,"Maybe in a future CL in case we want to keep changes to a minimum in this CL: It seems this function is only ever called from signin::AccountInfoSerializer::FromValue. Should we inline everything in…"],["92a43b01_594858fd",28,-1,1,"Move this near the avatar URL as they have the same treatment for empty values."],["a7a8f34a_7877019e",28,-1,0,"Just a question to make sure I understood it well: This means that if user info wants to differentiate ever between empty string and no value in the proto we receive, we will not be able to handle…"],["dad65e10_c488d000",26,-1,1,"Should we check here for non-empty account id?"]],0,1055],[7203187,20417,4,0.129,0.097,[[6,73]],[],0,1056],[7200688,20417,40,1.326,1.047,[[16,0.628,9,26],[30,0.372,1,14]],[],0,1057],[7201770,20417,3,0.142,0.092,[[31,8]],[],0,1058],[7200689,20417,11,0.407,0.29,[[4,218]],[["d6504b64_9f8bcefe",30,0,0,"When I saw this I was a little confused if this call even does anything. The commit messages describes it but maybe it could be useful to keep using a constant value instead of an empty string?"]],0,1059],[7203131,20417,4,0.242,0.169,[[32,0]],[],0,1060],[7202568,20417,4,0.248,0.178,[[13,50]],[],0,1061],[7201707,20417,83,2.344,1.853,[[33,2]],[],0,1062],[7200691,20417,7,0.28,0.2,[[31,9]],[],0,1063],[7203086,20417,5,0.28,0.2,[[31,10]],[],0,1064],[7200690,20417,10,0.407,0.29,[[4,219]],[],0,1065],[7203144,20417,13,0.407,0.29,[[34,0]],[],0,1066],[7201218,20418,6,0.28,0.2,[[31,11]],[["701e92ec_d16c71e6"